User Story:
As a user, I want to create groups to connect with people of similar geographic or language interests.

Acceptance Criteria:

A user can create a new group.
The group creator can define the group's name & description.
The group creator can associate the group with a country, region, or language.
The group creator can edit the groups information detailed above.
A user can browse from all groups and search for ones based on country, region, or language.
A user can join a group and as a group member be able to leave the group.
A user can see the groups they are members of.
A group member can see other members of that group.
